      en: ["Founded: 1st century BCE by the Nabateans.", "Location: 50 km southwest of Be'er Sheva.", "UNESCO World Heritage: since 2005 (as part of Incense Route).", "Churches: three Byzantine churches (5th/6th century CE).", "Agriculture: terraced fields and channels over 1,000 hectares.", "Water system: 20 cisterns, total capacity 2,000 m³."],
